//! # {{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-domain
//!
//! Domain core for {{project.name}}.
//! Contains entities, value objects, policies, and domain services.
//!
//! ## Design Rules
//!
//! - **Zero external dependencies** beyond serialization and error handling.
//! - Outer layers depend on the domain — never the reverse.
//! - All domain logic is synchronous and pure where possible.
//! - Domain errors are strongly typed via `thiserror`.
//!
//! ## Module Structure
//!
//! ```text
//! src/
//! ├── entities/      ← Aggregate roots and entities
//! ├── values/         ← Value objects
//! ├── services/       ← Domain services (stateless logic)
//! ├── errors.rs       ← Domain error types
//! └── lib.rs          ← Public API
//! ```

pub mod entities;
pub mod errors;
pub mod services;
pub mod values;
